e\" content=\"PYNGYN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.c